# --- Third-party reference material: never commit ---
# reference/ holds the purchased Wild Sheep Chase module PDF (not
# redistributable), the official SRD PDFs (the brief says link out rather
# than bundle them), and an unofficial community SRD conversion kept only
# as raw material for building rules/*.yaml.
reference/

# --- Local play state ---
# Session files are per-table state produced by the setup wizard, not
# adventure content. The sessions/ folders themselves stay tracked.
adventures/*/sessions/*.yaml
adventures/*/sessions/*.yml

